#
# Raw command output, kept byte for byte as the tools printed it: bpftool pads its columns and
# dpkg-query separates fields with tabs, so trailing whitespace here is evidence, not a defect.
# Raw HTTP headers end their lines with CRLF; `-text` stops git from converting line endings
# (as `core.autocrlf=input` would), so the files are committed exactly as captured.
* -whitespace -text
